repository-code: "https://github.com/saprimad/redscribe"
url: "https://github.com/saprimad/redscribe"
abstract: >-
  A Windows desktop application for research interview transcription using
  selectable Faster-Whisper models, optional pyannote.audio speaker
  diarisation, spoken-language selection, and structured Excel and editable
  Word exports for researcher-led verification and qualitative analysis.
keywords:
  - speech transcription
  - qualitative research
  - speaker diarisation
  - Faster-Whisper
  - pyannote.audio
  - Microsoft Word
  - Excel
  - research software
